{"id":"n31483-1-11","stage":1,"title":"샌드위치 · 三明治","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31483-1-11-1","ko":"점심에 시간도 없는데 샌드위치나 먹을까?","zh":"中午都没时间了，要不吃个三明治吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심에","meaning":"中午","explanation":"점심：中午；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"2","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간도","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는데","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샌드위치나","meaning":"三明治","explanation":"샌드위치：三明治；나：连接可以选择的名词，表示“或、或者”。","readings":[{"term":"샌드위치","audio":"/audio/fc9328a0db3a24a7a670.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31483","senseId":"1","lemma":"샌드위치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹을까?","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中午","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"一天中太阳在最高位置的，早上和晚上中间的时间。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"fc9328a0db3a24a7","term":"샌드위치","zh":"三明治","audio":"/audio/fc9328a0db3a24a7a670.mp3","entryId":"31483","definition":"两片面包之间夹入蔬菜、 肉类、 鸡蛋及芝士等而做成的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/059dd7786182aa93da45.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n31483-1-11-2","ko":"그래. 점심은 간단하게 먹자.","zh":"好啊。午餐就简单吃点吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"점심은","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간단하게","meaning":"简便，轻便，简单","explanation":"간단하다：简便，轻便，简单；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"간단하다","audio":"/audio/f6dc36bb270a1ad55beb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70702","senseId":"2","lemma":"간단하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹자.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"f6dc36bb270a1ad5","term":"간단하다","zh":"简便，轻便，简单","audio":"/audio/f6dc36bb270a1ad55beb.mp3","entryId":"70702","definition":"不麻烦或不多。","pronunciation":["간단하다"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/dc1a7691cbb392f1a8ba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.933,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=31483","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":39,"sequenceScore":1.7597,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["中午都没时间了，要不吃个三明治吧？","好啊。午餐就简单吃点吧。","今天有几个人迟到了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["中午都没时间了，要不吃个三明治吧？","好啊。午餐就简单吃点吧。","今天有几个人迟到了？"],"answer":1}]}
